# AI workflow: ECC (https://github.com/affaan-m/ECC). The curated agents,
# commands, skills and rules under .claude/ are committed so every machine runs
# the same workflow — see .claude/ECC.md. Only per-machine state stays out:
# personal settings and the elysiajs skill, which is restored from
# skills-lock.json with `bunx skills add elysiajs/skills`.
